      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. Regarding the \"Specific Wording\" point you were about to make—does the presence of \"catch-all\" language in a force majeure clause usually help or hurt a tenant's position in Singaporean case law? And are there specific recent precedents involving business interruptions we should be aware of?",
